  "prefLabel": "Plc 802.01 Contact information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 802.01 “Contact information” means the individual’s designated email address, home or other personal telephone number, and home physical address and home mailing address, if different.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
